  <metadata>
    <title>Notifications and Daily Briefing target PEOPLE (Created By, Assigned To), never owner teams or business units; server to-do writers set Assigned To; membership events state the row's real owner</title>
    <phase>Register-driven (authored 2026-09-30, session 27; owner round-2 item 9 "Notifications" and Q8, the membership half of GitHub #1044 plus the #1044 split agreed with word-add-in-r1, ADR-034 event semantics)</phase>
